    "evidence_id": 8,
    "text": "Meanwhile, visual simulation media supports conceptual understanding by making abstract optics content more tangible (Anggraini et al., 2021; Sarwinda et al., 2020)."
  },
  {
    "evidence_id": 9,
    "text": "In physics learning, students are encouraged to be able to identify, solve problems, analyse, conclude, and evaluate (Astutik et al, 2020)."
  }
]

